WEBVTT

01:46.640 --> 01:47.970
You are really pitiful.

01:48.789 --> 01:51.400
You are the loneliest person in the world.

02:58.079 --> 03:00.710
My unique talent I'm proud of

03:01.470 --> 03:04.120
can be easily seen through

03:04.400 --> 03:05.710
by your Truth Eye.

03:07.560 --> 03:09.310
A destined enemy like you

03:10.910 --> 03:12.240
is so boring.

03:15.830 --> 03:17.750
I shall give you the Truth Eye.

03:18.520 --> 03:19.280
In this way,

03:19.800 --> 03:22.240
no one in the world can see through you.

03:23.030 --> 03:23.840
Zhu Yan.

03:25.680 --> 03:27.030
Won't you regret it?

03:29.150 --> 03:30.210
How long has it been

03:30.750 --> 03:32.550
since we played Go so peacefully

03:33.120 --> 03:34.710
as we are now?

03:36.590 --> 03:38.050
I don't remember anymore.

03:43.550 --> 03:44.360
Indeed.

03:47.360 --> 03:48.310
Some things

03:49.590 --> 03:51.120
are better forgotten.

03:51.590 --> 03:53.680
Sacrificing a pawn to gain an advantage,

03:53.680 --> 03:56.280
advancing step by step with careful strategy.

03:56.630 --> 03:58.560
In the end, you only took one piece.

04:00.240 --> 04:01.400
Is this fun?

04:03.750 --> 04:06.810
As expected, after staying with humans for a long time,

04:07.190 --> 04:08.520
you start

04:09.800 --> 04:11.470
beating around the bush too.

04:13.590 --> 04:14.840
Life is like chess.

04:16.390 --> 04:17.950
If you were wrong right from the start...

04:17.950 --> 04:20.269
Life is like chess?

04:23.240 --> 04:25.000
But I don't want to be a human.

04:28.430 --> 04:30.000
You are the one

04:32.240 --> 04:33.440
who wants to be human.

04:34.190 --> 04:35.830
One of us

04:36.560 --> 04:38.159
will lose,

04:39.600 --> 04:40.860
and the other will win.

04:42.510 --> 04:44.159
We can draw too.

04:48.870 --> 04:49.800
Draw?

04:53.750 --> 04:55.159
You said it yourself.

05:03.190 --> 05:04.430
We can draw.

05:05.120 --> 05:07.120
I don't mind being the best with you.

05:07.390 --> 05:09.590
You still have a chance to make up for it.

05:13.720 --> 05:14.510
How?

05:18.040 --> 05:19.630
Leave Bai Jiu's body

05:24.040 --> 05:25.310
and let him live.

05:33.159 --> 05:33.950
Zhu Yan.

05:38.240 --> 05:40.000
Your peace resolution

05:42.159 --> 05:44.240
is for me to die?

05:47.670 --> 05:49.040
He is your friend.

05:52.360 --> 05:53.480
I was

05:55.560 --> 05:57.070
your friend too.

06:45.190 --> 06:46.000
Zhao Yuanzhou.

06:46.000 --> 06:46.680
What's wrong?

06:46.680 --> 06:47.409
Great Demon!

06:53.430 --> 06:54.280
Great Demon?

06:56.120 --> 06:57.980
He has lost all his demonic power.

06:59.270 --> 07:01.270
He's no different from a human.

07:04.480 --> 07:05.740
Your demonic power...

07:06.360 --> 07:08.890
Was it to rebuild the Cloud Light Sword for me?

07:09.750 --> 07:10.560
No.

07:12.390 --> 07:13.830
I'm here to save Bai Jiu.

07:15.070 --> 07:16.070
Zhao Yuanzhou...

07:17.800 --> 07:19.870
You made yourself such a mess.

07:21.600 --> 07:24.060
You don't deserve to be my opponent anymore.

07:25.160 --> 07:25.950
Li Lun.

07:27.270 --> 07:28.360
Your opponent

07:29.240 --> 07:30.120
is me.

07:30.870 --> 07:31.680
Zhuo!

07:39.480 --> 07:40.340
Zhao Yuanzhou.

07:41.830 --> 07:42.750
Lord Bai Yan,

07:42.750 --> 07:43.880
I'll leave it to you.

07:43.920 --> 07:44.680
Goddess,

07:44.800 --> 07:45.860
I will protect you.

08:02.630 --> 08:03.890
With a human's body...

08:04.920 --> 08:06.180
That's seeking death.

08:38.510 --> 08:39.200
Heng.

09:08.270 --> 09:10.730
Bingyi Sword Technique is indeed powerful.

09:11.670 --> 09:13.270
But you don't dare to hurt me.

09:13.790 --> 09:15.390
By avoiding the vital parts,

09:16.790 --> 09:18.320
you will lose.

09:42.200 --> 09:42.910
Wen Xiao!

09:43.320 --> 09:44.910
The poison in your body hasn't been detoxified.

09:44.910 --> 09:45.770
Don't force it!

10:08.750 --> 10:09.480
Wen Xiao.

10:14.520 --> 10:15.790
We must control him.

10:17.910 --> 10:20.570
Otherwise Zhuo can't take away Li Lun's spirit.

10:21.270 --> 10:22.600
If anything goes wrong,

10:23.270 --> 10:25.550
both Li Lun and Jiu will perish.

11:12.360 --> 11:13.360
Wen Xiao.

12:17.440 --> 12:18.670
What are you afraid of?

12:18.670 --> 12:19.360
I'm here.

12:19.630 --> 12:20.160
Let's go!

12:23.750 --> 12:24.240
J...

12:26.480 --> 12:27.270
Jiu...

12:29.150 --> 12:29.960
Jiu!

12:50.600 --> 12:51.550
I was not used to

12:53.030 --> 12:54.290
not having you around.

13:12.630 --> 13:13.550
Ying Lei!

13:15.750 --> 13:17.360
Mr. Zhuo!

13:54.510 --> 13:56.170
The root of the pagoda tree...

13:58.760 --> 14:01.270
I gave you my Truth Eye.

14:03.600 --> 14:05.870
You gave me the root of your pagoda tree.

14:08.390 --> 14:10.080
We used to be best friends,

14:11.910 --> 14:13.970
but now we turned against each other.

14:18.510 --> 14:20.770
The pagoda tree is your primordial tree.

14:21.390 --> 14:24.050
If you remove your inner core from Bai Jiu's body

14:25.080 --> 14:26.870
and lead it to the root of the pagoda tree,

14:26.870 --> 14:29.130
after you cultivate for a hundred years,

14:29.390 --> 14:31.670
you can still take human form.

14:36.510 --> 14:39.710
Zhao Yuanzhou still doesn't want your soul to disappear.

14:40.360 --> 14:42.320
This is his last mercy to you.

14:53.480 --> 14:54.270
Promise me

14:58.080 --> 14:59.670
to spare his life.

15:06.390 --> 15:07.200
Tell him...

15:40.240 --> 15:41.510
I did it.

15:53.390 --> 15:53.960
Ying Lei.

15:54.360 --> 15:55.360
Jiu is fine.

15:55.630 --> 15:56.600
Pass him to me.

16:19.320 --> 16:20.120
Little girl,

16:20.550 --> 16:21.960
the temple is a solemn place.

16:21.960 --> 16:22.910
Please be quiet.

16:23.080 --> 16:24.610
Who are you calling "Miss"?

16:24.750 --> 16:26.880
Go take some medicine if you're blind!

16:27.750 --> 16:28.840
Why is your name

16:28.840 --> 16:29.390
Bai Jiu?

16:29.720 --> 16:32.080
Why not Yellow Wine or Hua Tiao?

16:45.200 --> 16:46.270
Mr. Zhuo...

17:21.069 --> 17:21.680
Ying Lei.

17:30.400 --> 17:31.350
Mr. Zhuo...

17:35.350 --> 17:36.270
Jiu...

17:38.960 --> 17:40.240
admires you the most.

17:45.240 --> 17:46.550
This time,

17:46.830 --> 17:47.550
it was me...

17:47.880 --> 17:49.200
who saved him...

18:02.270 --> 18:03.400
Mountain God.

18:07.640 --> 18:08.790
You're amazing.

18:17.270 --> 18:18.790
I like...

18:22.200 --> 18:23.960
hearing Mr. Zhuo...

18:32.400 --> 18:33.070
calling me

18:33.550 --> 18:34.640
amazing...

18:37.590 --> 18:38.160
Jiu.

18:38.160 --> 18:39.090
You're amazing.

18:39.640 --> 18:40.440
What about me?

18:41.110 --> 18:42.720
Shouldn't you praise me?

18:45.310 --> 18:46.570
Mountain God Ying Lei,

18:46.710 --> 18:47.840
you're amazing too.

19:03.720 --> 19:05.000
You're better than me.

19:11.720 --> 19:13.750
You're the hero who saved Jiu.

19:27.670 --> 19:28.910
You are the best

19:30.440 --> 19:31.400
mountain god

19:32.310 --> 19:33.920
I've ever seen.

19:36.110 --> 19:38.480
You're also the best cook.

20:05.680 --> 20:06.480
Jiu.

20:08.310 --> 20:09.510
You'll surely become

20:10.550 --> 20:12.350
the best physician in the world.

20:13.510 --> 20:14.310
Go for it.

20:21.110 --> 20:22.160
Jiu...

20:25.590 --> 20:27.240
You'll surely become

20:28.350 --> 20:29.270
the greatest

20:29.510 --> 20:30.000
Doc...

20:30.830 --> 20:32.270
Doctor...

20:34.920 --> 20:35.780
in the world...

20:43.160 --> 20:44.270
Demon!

20:46.480 --> 20:47.680
Little Mountain God!

20:48.590 --> 20:49.350
Ying Lei!

20:50.240 --> 20:50.880
Ying Lei.

20:50.880 --> 20:51.590
I'm ready.

20:52.070 --> 20:52.930
Are you coming?

20:53.160 --> 20:53.750
Let's go.

21:15.000 --> 21:15.790
Mr. Zhuo...

21:25.200 --> 21:26.070
I want to

21:26.720 --> 21:28.200
stay with

21:29.960 --> 21:32.070
everyone.

21:33.750 --> 21:34.510
I'm...

21:35.960 --> 21:37.720
scared.

24:19.480 --> 24:20.200
Jiu.

24:23.830 --> 24:24.350
Mom.

24:34.480 --> 24:35.160
Mom.

24:37.160 --> 24:38.350
I'm sorry.

24:40.480 --> 24:42.140
I made you wait for a long time.

24:47.070 --> 24:47.880
Mom.

25:08.000 --> 25:09.550
We can draw.

25:26.030 --> 25:27.160
Li Lun

25:27.480 --> 25:28.510
left this message

25:29.590 --> 25:30.680
for you.

25:33.030 --> 25:33.720
Tell him...

25:37.350 --> 25:38.240
this time...

25:43.240 --> 25:44.160
This time...

25:45.720 --> 25:47.510
we draw.

26:02.480 --> 26:04.000
Why didn't you tell us?

26:04.830 --> 26:07.240
After you forged the sword with Ever-Burning Wood,

26:07.240 --> 26:09.240
you've lost all your demonic power.

26:09.830 --> 26:10.920
Would saying it

26:12.070 --> 26:13.130
make a difference?

26:15.270 --> 26:17.000
This sword must be cultivated.

26:17.920 --> 26:19.960
Wen Xiao risked her life for this.

26:20.720 --> 26:21.920
So what if I don't have

26:22.920 --> 26:24.380
my demonic power anymore?

26:25.160 --> 26:27.020
But you're worse than a human now.

26:28.430 --> 26:29.920
Normal people

26:29.920 --> 26:31.200
are not that weak.

26:32.400 --> 26:33.270
Look.

26:34.200 --> 26:35.440
I don't want to tell you

26:35.440 --> 26:37.830
because I don't want to see you like this.

26:39.510 --> 26:42.270
Every generation of the Bingyi Clan is the God of War.

26:42.270 --> 26:44.640
But your gaze is so resentful right now.

26:45.200 --> 26:47.000
If your Bingyi ancestors see it,

26:47.400 --> 26:49.200
they'll beat you to death.

26:49.790 --> 26:51.320
What are you talking about?

26:53.920 --> 26:55.480
I'm more used to

26:56.920 --> 26:58.120
hearing you scold me.

27:11.830 --> 27:12.750
Let's go.

28:02.440 --> 28:03.070
Ying Lei!

28:05.030 --> 28:05.680
Ying Lei!

28:07.240 --> 28:07.880
Ying Lei!

28:15.830 --> 28:16.680
Ying Lei!

28:18.880 --> 28:19.680
Ying Lei!

28:21.550 --> 28:22.440
Ying Lei!

28:23.480 --> 28:24.590
Ying Lei!

28:29.240 --> 28:29.960
Ying Lei!

28:35.270 --> 28:36.000
Ying Lei!

28:36.750 --> 28:37.280
Ying Lei!

28:39.400 --> 28:40.070
Ying Lei!

28:40.590 --> 28:41.160
Ying Lei!

28:44.160 --> 28:44.750
Jiu.

29:35.720 --> 29:36.510
Jiu.

29:37.350 --> 29:38.510
Cry if you want.

29:38.920 --> 29:39.920
I'll be with you.

29:42.470 --> 29:43.070
Tears

29:43.310 --> 29:44.710
has nothing to do with age

29:45.640 --> 29:48.100
and nothing to do with strength or weakness.

29:48.590 --> 29:50.720
It has something to do with our hearts.

29:51.920 --> 29:53.380
Humans are soft-hearted.

29:55.160 --> 29:56.400
Soft things

29:57.510 --> 30:00.720
will always be pricked by something hard and cold.

30:02.200 --> 30:03.000
Death

30:04.310 --> 30:05.720
is the hardest and coldest thing

30:05.720 --> 30:08.070
in this world.

30:12.200 --> 30:14.750
Ying Lei asked me to bring this to you.

30:16.110 --> 30:17.070
I brought it.

30:18.640 --> 30:20.120
Ying Lei left it for me?

30:20.310 --> 30:20.640
Yes.

30:30.920 --> 30:31.920
It looks like

30:32.550 --> 30:33.790
almond cheese.

30:36.880 --> 30:39.110
My mom's almond cheese is better.

30:40.000 --> 30:41.000
Almond cheese?

30:41.510 --> 30:42.160
Yes.

30:42.160 --> 30:43.070
Got it.

30:47.400 --> 30:48.510
This little cook

30:50.240 --> 30:51.560
is really a fool.

30:53.590 --> 30:55.000
Who makes a whole pickle jar

30:55.000 --> 30:56.000
of almond cheese?

30:56.680 --> 30:58.340
It'll spoil in just a few days.

31:14.680 --> 31:15.310
Ying Lei.

31:16.920 --> 31:18.870
Are you making pomegranate wine again?

31:18.870 --> 31:19.640
No.

31:20.000 --> 31:21.960
It's almond cheese.

31:23.270 --> 31:24.440
Silly kid.

31:25.070 --> 31:26.110
It'll spoil

31:26.110 --> 31:27.170
if you make so many.

31:28.590 --> 31:30.000
Just use some spells.

31:30.400 --> 31:31.590
I've figured it out.

31:32.920 --> 31:35.250
No wonder your grandpa always scolds you.

31:35.310 --> 31:36.830
He said you always use your power

31:36.830 --> 31:38.680
on important things.

31:38.880 --> 31:40.240
Who said it's not important?

31:40.240 --> 31:41.440
It's very important.

31:43.830 --> 31:45.030
My grandpa never understood

31:45.030 --> 31:46.550
why I want to be a cook.

31:47.270 --> 31:50.070
That's because he seldom goes to the mortal world.

31:50.480 --> 31:52.750
Behind every favorite dish,

31:53.070 --> 31:55.270
there is someone who cares about you the most.

31:55.270 --> 31:56.070
One's mother,

31:56.720 --> 31:57.510
brother,

31:57.960 --> 31:58.750
lover,

31:59.880 --> 32:00.680
and friend.

32:02.000 --> 32:03.880
Only those who cherish you the most

32:03.880 --> 32:05.960
will always cook the same dish for you.

32:05.960 --> 32:06.920
I heard that

32:07.270 --> 32:08.440
all homesickness

32:08.920 --> 32:10.400
can be turned into a dish.

32:11.920 --> 32:13.320
It can tug on your stomach

32:14.400 --> 32:15.550
and your heart.

32:16.920 --> 32:18.650
So that when you wander around,

32:19.550 --> 32:21.030
you always want to go home.

32:21.750 --> 32:22.810
When Jiu comes back

32:22.990 --> 32:24.310
and eat the almond cheese

32:24.310 --> 32:26.400
his mom made for him the most,

32:27.590 --> 32:28.790
he must be very happy.

32:38.030 --> 32:39.400
Give it to him yourself.

32:40.000 --> 32:41.460
Why are you giving it to me?

33:19.670 --> 33:21.270
I don't listen to my grandpa.

33:22.240 --> 33:24.040
But my grandpa has a good saying.

33:26.640 --> 33:27.350
Ying Lei,

33:28.200 --> 33:31.000
if you want to be the best cook in the world,

33:31.750 --> 33:33.810
you need to know all kinds of flavors.

33:34.720 --> 33:35.720
There are only

33:36.510 --> 33:37.910
two places on a human body

33:38.270 --> 33:40.000
that can taste.

33:41.510 --> 33:42.750
One is tongue,

33:43.750 --> 33:44.550
and the other

33:47.160 --> 33:47.960
is heart.

34:10.110 --> 34:10.960
Sister Pei.

34:12.630 --> 34:14.880
Are you sad about Ying Lei's death?

34:16.670 --> 34:17.960
I'm not sad.

34:21.070 --> 34:22.199
I'm blaming myself.

34:24.710 --> 34:26.320
If I could be stronger

34:27.710 --> 34:28.800
and more powerful,

34:29.880 --> 34:32.150
maybe Ying Lei wouldn't have died.

34:33.960 --> 34:35.389
I'm also a human.

34:36.150 --> 34:37.320
So is Zhuo.

34:38.840 --> 34:40.070
But we

34:40.880 --> 34:42.400
are all indispensable.

34:45.590 --> 34:47.070
You’re the Baize Goddess.

34:48.000 --> 34:50.130
Mr. Zhuo is from the Bingyi bloodline.

34:50.550 --> 34:51.840
I'm the only

34:54.280 --> 34:56.440
most useless mortal.

34:58.000 --> 34:59.510
I couldn't save Jiu

35:06.150 --> 35:07.760
nor Ying Lei.

35:17.630 --> 35:21.030
Now I need my brother's puppet to protect me.

35:22.920 --> 35:24.840
If you hadn't protected me,

35:25.800 --> 35:26.880
I would have died.

35:28.150 --> 35:30.280
No one can protect everyone.

35:32.920 --> 35:34.320
Great Demon is so strong.

35:35.320 --> 35:37.070
He needs us sometimes.

35:38.920 --> 35:40.510
He wouldn't need me.

35:44.110 --> 35:45.400
But I need you.

36:07.510 --> 36:09.640
Before you know how to protect others,

36:10.840 --> 36:13.300
you have to learn to protect yourself first.

36:14.710 --> 36:15.760
Got it?

36:16.960 --> 36:18.670
Brother Zhuo will protect me.

36:27.670 --> 36:28.960
Maybe after this,

36:30.550 --> 36:31.000
I...

36:31.400 --> 36:32.200
Brother Zhuo.

36:33.030 --> 36:34.000
What did you say?

36:38.070 --> 36:39.800
I said you're a skilled doctor.

36:40.360 --> 36:42.440
You should know how to protect and take care of

36:42.440 --> 36:46.280
these friends around you who've been through thick and thin with you.

36:46.280 --> 36:47.190
Of course.

36:48.280 --> 36:50.110
I'm confident in this.

36:56.190 --> 36:57.710
Especially Wen.

37:01.400 --> 37:02.590
She's unlucky.

37:05.840 --> 37:08.570
She's always riddled with troubles and illness.

37:11.150 --> 37:12.840
Take care of her health.

37:14.880 --> 37:16.070
As for Ms. Pei,

37:17.360 --> 37:19.070
she can take care of herself,

37:22.440 --> 37:24.040
but she sometimes acts tough

37:26.360 --> 37:27.760
and would feel inferior.

37:30.510 --> 37:31.710
And Zhao Yuanzhou...

37:32.840 --> 37:33.760
Wait.

37:34.840 --> 37:35.760
Brother Zhuo.

37:38.070 --> 37:39.320
Why do I feel

37:39.320 --> 37:41.030
you're acting weird today?

37:42.920 --> 37:43.710
Maybe

37:47.150 --> 37:49.210
the departure of Little Mountain God

37:51.630 --> 37:53.840
made me cherish you more.

38:02.480 --> 38:04.000
Can the poison on Wen Xiao

38:05.000 --> 38:06.460
really not be detoxified?

38:08.510 --> 38:10.040
There is no antidote at all.

38:12.230 --> 38:14.760
Unless someone is willing to use their demonic power

38:14.760 --> 38:17.020
to absorb the poison into their own body.

38:22.480 --> 38:24.000
That's what he said.

38:31.510 --> 38:32.550
Looks like

38:33.960 --> 38:36.190
we can only find another way.

38:38.480 --> 38:39.070
Ao Yin

38:40.030 --> 38:43.360
transferred the poison in her body away with demonic power.

38:45.440 --> 38:46.840
She transferred it away?

38:50.320 --> 38:51.320
Don't tell

38:52.440 --> 38:53.920
Mr. Zhuo about this.

39:00.320 --> 39:01.320
I understand.

39:02.840 --> 39:03.880
But Wen Xiao

39:04.920 --> 39:06.710
won't let you do that.

39:30.230 --> 39:31.030
Let's go.
